[Opening "English Opening"]
[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. c4 {The English: you fight for d5 from the side, without showing your plan yet.} e5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. Nf3 Nc6 4. g3 {Your bishop goes to g2 – it will look along the long diagonal.} d5 5. cxd5 Nxd5 6. Bg2 Nb6 7. d3 {Calm: castle and attack Black's center later.} Be7 8. Be3 O-O 9. O-O *

