[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. c4 c5 {Black copies you.} 2. Nc3 Nc6 3. g3 g6 4. Bg2 Bg7 5. e3 {Prepare d4 – and the knight goes to e2.} e6 6. Nge2 Nge7 7. d4 *

[Event "Scotch: 4...Bc5"]
[Opening "Scotch Game"]
[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 {The Scotch: open the center at once.} exd4 4. Nxd4 Bc5 {The bishop attacks your knight.} 5. Nb3 {Step back – and attack the bishop on c5 in return.} Bb6 6. Nc3 Nf6 7. Bg5 {Pin the knight.} h6 8. Bh4 *

[Event "Scotch: 4...Nf6"]
[Opening "Scotch Game"]
[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 exd4 4. Nxd4 Nf6 5. Nxc6 bxc6 6. e5 {Kick the knight.} Qe7 7. Qe2 {Pin back: e5 is protected.} Nd5 8. c4 {Chase the knight again.} Nb6 9. Nc3 {Develop – Black's pieces stand awkwardly.} g6 *

[Event "Slav: Quiet 4.e3"]
[Opening "Slav Defense"]
[Side "Black"]
[Result "*"]

1. d4 d5 2. c4 c6 3. Nf3 Nf6 4. e3 {White closes in the light bishop – yours can still come out.} Bf5 {The Slav idea: bishop out before ...e6.} 5. Nc3 e6 6. Nh4 {White hunts your bishop.} Bg6 {Step back – if White takes, you get the open h-file for your rook.} 7. Nxg6 hxg6 8. Qb3 Qc7 *

