[Opening "Scotch Game"]
[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 Nxd4 {Black trades knights at once.} 4. Nxd4 exd4 5. Qxd4 {Your queen takes the center pawn – and stands strong on d4.} Qf6 6. e5 {Push the queen away with tempo.} Qb6 7. Qxb6 axb6 *

[Event "Scotch: 4...Qh4"]
[Opening "Scotch Game"]
[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. d4 exd4 4. Nxd4 Qh4 {The queen attacks e4.} 5. Nc3 {Develop and protect e4 – do not panic.} Bb4 6. Be2 {Let Black take on e4: your pieces come out fast.} Qxe4 7. Nb5 {Threat: Nxc7+, a fork of king and rook!} Bxc3+ 8. bxc3 *
